Ever wanted to take notes digitally, but don't want to buy a whole tablet?

We have a solution! The AI Pen will allow you to take notes without needing to buy bulky and unprofessional digital tools!
Simply attach this device to your pen and write away! The pen will automatically transmit data to your computer, where a 
machine learning model will interpret your inputs as text that it will document.

Proof of concept prototype is complete, the current prototype can successfully map pen movements to a 3d space, and a machine 
learning model can translate these movements into characters with 67% accuracy.

